                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">This simple definition creates a parametric twisted tower from three sliders.

A glTF 2.0 Display component is used to show geometry in the online App.

A Download Export component is included to let users export the created geometry to 3dm.

Some numerical data about the created tower is also extracted so we can later display it in the App.</item>
